1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Chirp chirp! Hello friends! I'm Pip the Bird! Come fly through the alphabet garden with me and Penny!

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Let's sing our magical ABC phonics song!

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:20,000
A is for Apple, a-a-apple sweet, B is for Ball that bounces at our feet!

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000
C is for Cat saying meow meow meow, Look at all the letters that we're learning now!

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:36,000
A, B, C, D, sing along with me, Letters are as happy as happy can be!

6
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Chirp the sounds, clap to the beat, Reading with Pip is such a sunny treat!

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:52,000
D is for Duck saying quack quack quack, E is for Elephant with trunks right on track!

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,000
F is for Frog hopping in the spring, Oh what joyful happiness letters bring!

9
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:06,000
A, B, C, D, sing along with me, Letters are as happy as happy can be!

10
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:14,000
Chirp the sounds, clap to the beat, Reading with Pip is such a sunny treat!

11
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,000
You know your phonics sounds so well! Pip the Bird is cheering for you! Hooray!

12
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Keep singing your ABCs! Bye-bye!
